            "value": "Dashboard output is fixed at 480×272 JPEG, up to 20 FPS. CarPlay on this iPhone uses H.264 at 960×544 and 30 FPS. Audio plays through the iPhone or Bluetooth; the dashboard does not send touch input back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
