    "先在 duckdns.org 注册自己的域名。Token 可修改账号中的域名，请像密码一样保管；仅保存在本机 Keychain。此处将域名指向当前局域网地址，不开放公网端口。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Register your own domain at duckdns.org first. The token can modify domains in your account, so keep it secure like a password. It is stored only in this device’s Keychain. This points the domain to the current local network address and does not open any public ports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先在 duckdns.org 注册自己的域名。Token 可修改账号中的域名，请像密码一样保管；仅保存在本机 Keychain。此处将域名指向当前局域网地址，不开放公网端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先在系统设置连接 Wi-Fi，再在 CarWithin 选择对应预设。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
