          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有画面时，保持 CarWithin 运行，再到九号出行开启投屏导航。仪表出画后，可尝试从多任务界面划掉九号出行；若仪表随之退出投屏，则该型号需要保留官方会话。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If no picture appears, keep CarWithin running, then enable navigation casting in the Ninebot app. Once the dashboard shows a picture, try closing the Ninebot app from the app switcher. If casting stops, that model requires the official app session to remain running."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有画面时，保持 CarWithin 运行，再到九号出行开启投屏导航。仪表出画后，可尝试从多任务界面划掉九号出行；若仪表随之退出投屏，则该型号需要保留官方会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
