    "锁屏前，请在 iPhone「设置 › 通用 › CarPlay › CarWithin」中打开「锁定时允许 CarPlay」。后台运行会增加耗电。画中画仅显示实时画面。离开 App 时自动开启需打开 iPhone「设置 › 通用 › 画中画」中的自动选项。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before locking the iPhone, enable “Allow CarPlay While Locked” in Settings › General › CarPlay › CarWithin. Running in the background uses more battery. Picture in Picture shows live video only. To start it automatically when leaving the app, enable “Start PiP Automatically” in Settings › General › Picture in Picture."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁屏前，请在 iPhone「设置 › 通用 › CarPlay › CarWithin」中打开「锁定时允许 CarPlay」。后台运行会增加耗电。画中画仅显示实时画面。离开 App 时自动开启需打开 iPhone「设置 › 通用 › 画中画」中的自动选项。"
          }
        }
      }
