    "，在「设置」安装。之后进入「通用 → 关于本机 → 证书信任设置」，为该证书启用完全信任。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", install it in Settings, then go to General → About → Certificate Trust Settings and enable full trust for this certificate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "，在「设置」安装。之后进入「通用 → 关于本机 → 证书信任设置」，为该证书启用完全信任。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，在系统「设置」搜索「安装证书」，选择「CA 证书」，安装下载的文件。不同机型的菜单名称可能不同。安装后用支持系统用户证书的浏览器打开 HTTPS 接收页。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", search for “Install certificate” in system Settings, select “CA certificate”, and install the downloaded file. Menu names vary by device. Then open the HTTPS receiver page in a browser that supports user-installed system certificates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "，在系统「设置」搜索「安装证书」，选择「CA 证书」，安装下载的文件。不同机型的菜单名称可能不同。安装后用支持系统用户证书的浏览器打开 HTTPS 接收页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
