    "打开车机上的亿连，让 iPhone 和车机连入同一 Wi-Fi。在连接设置中扫码或选择车机，然后启动本机 CarPlay。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open CarbitLink on the head unit and connect the iPhone to the same Wi-Fi. In Connection Settings, scan the code or select the head unit, then start local CarPlay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开车机上的亿连，让 iPhone 和车机连入同一 Wi-Fi。在连接设置中扫码或选择车机，然后启动本机 CarPlay。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
