    "在车机打开亿连，iPhone 加入同一局域网并保存 Wi-Fi 预设。支持触控回传的车机可点按和拖动 CarPlay 画面。iPhone 提供可触控的低帧率预览，也可开启画中画；声音走 iPhone 或蓝牙。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open CarbitLink on the head unit, join the same local network on iPhone, and save the Wi-Fi preset. Head units with touch return support can tap and drag the CarPlay picture. The iPhone shows a touch-enabled reduced-frame-rate preview that also feeds Picture in Picture. Audio plays through the iPhone or Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在车机打开亿连，iPhone 加入同一局域网并保存 Wi-Fi 预设。支持触控回传的车机可点按和拖动 CarPlay 画面。iPhone 提供可触控的低帧率预览，也可开启画中画；声音走 iPhone 或蓝牙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在此 Wi-Fi 查找亿连服务。若车机未广播服务，可返回填写车机 IP。": {
